    12	
    13	1. **Extensibility** — adding a provider means editing every shared file.
    14	2. **Machine-local relevance** — nothing skips providers absent from this machine.
    15	3. **Shareability** — no self-contained unit another user can take safely.
    16	4. **Harness portability** — the sdd skill must wrap superpowers:subagent-driven-development
    17	   from BOTH Claude Code and Codex CLI as controller (superpowers itself ships a Codex
