    20	## Decisions
    21	
    22	| Fork | Decision |
    23	| --- | --- |
    24	| Unit of split | Provider packs inside this plugin (`providers/<name>/`); core stays shared. |
    25	| Availability | Derived detection from a declarative manifest (no pack-authored shell) + layered config. |
    26	| Policy table | Core defines roles→(tier, lane); each pack maps (tier, lane)→models with explicit priority. |
    27	| Harness | Harness-neutral entry skill + thin per-harness adapters. Controller harness and external provider are separate session concepts. |
    28	| Validation | A deterministic validator/resolver script + fixture packs is IN scope; real-CLI probes remain environment smoke tests, not universal release gates. |
